# MINIX 1.1 source code
Repo includes the MINIX 1.1 source code.

Setting up an appropriate 8086/8088 cross-compiler on modern hardware proved
easier with Bruce Evans's bcc/as86/ld86, rathen than the original MINIX
toolchain (ACK - Amsterdam Compiler Kit). Minimal updates to the MINIX source
code are included to work with this newer toolchain.

## Dependencies
- bcc (0.16.21 used)
- as86 (0.16.21 used)
- ld86 (0.16.21 used)

